    <!-- Help Screen -->
    <string name="help_center_title">Help Center</string>
    <string name="faq_title">Frequently Asked Questions</string>
    <string name="faq_subtitle">Find answers to your problems below</string>
    <string name="help_more_title">Still Need Help?</string>
    <string name="help_more_msg">Contact our support team via email at https://chesko-25.vercel.app for further assistance.</string>

    <string name="faq_q1">How to add a playlist?</string>
    <string name="faq_a1">You can add a playlist by pressing the \'Add\' button on the login screen, then enter a valid M3U URL or select a file from your device storage.</string>
    <string name="faq_q2">Why can\'t the channel be played?</string>
    <string name="faq_a2">Make sure your internet connection is stable. Some channels may require a VPN or have regional restrictions. If the problem persists, contact your playlist provider.</string>
    <string name="faq_q3">How to see the TV guide (EPG)?</string>
    <string name="faq_a3">Open the Menu Drawer (three-line icon top left) then select \'TV Guide\'. EPG will automatically download if the playlist source provides it.</string>
    <string name="faq_q4">How to add to Favorites?</string>
    <string name="faq_a4">While playing a video, press the \'Star\' icon in the player controls. Or you can long-press on a channel item in the home list.</string>
    <string name="faq_q5">The app feels slow, what to do?</string>
    <string name="faq_a5">You can try clearing the cache in Android Settings, or reduce the number of active playlists if there are too many.</string>

